p.src:
The pattern now extends mechanically. Every upper primed index brings one factor of $\partial y/\partial x$; every lower primed index brings one factor of $\partial x/\partial y$. A mixed tensor transforms as $T'^m{}_n
 =
 \frac{\partial y^m}{\partial x^p}
 \frac{\partial x^q}{\partial y^n}
 T^p{}_q,$ and a rank-two covariant tensor transforms as $W'_{mn}
 =
 \frac{\partial x^p}{\partial y^m}
 \frac{\partial x^q}{\partial y^n}
 W_{pq}.$

